# Django REST API base URL (must include /api/v1).
# Unset, the app uses the deployed pre-production backend (see src/lib/api.ts).
# To develop against a local Django server instead, copy this file to .env and uncomment:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
# On Vercel, set it under Project Settings > Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://team-027-pre-prod.vercel.app/api/v1
